<title>UK: STB Cayman prices 100 bln yen exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>STB Cayman prices 100 bln yen exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STB CAYMAN CAPITAL LTD</p>
<p> AMT   *100 BLN YEN   COUPON     0.5 PCT   MATURITY    01.OCT.07</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  PAR	 LISTING     LUX</p>
<p>PAY FREQ SEMI-ANN DENOMS (M) FIVE NOTES GUARANTEED ON A SUBORDINATED BASIS BY SUMITOMO AND BANKING CO.</p>
<p>EXCHANGEABLE FOR COMMON STOCK OF THE SUMITOMO TRUST AND BANKING CO LTD</p>
<p>*WITH 10.0 PERCENT GREENSHOE OPTION</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
